 921:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             operation to I2C_SATR1 register (I2C_GetFlagStatus()) followed by a 
 922:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             read/write to I2C_DATAR register (I2C_SendData()).
 923:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *           - ADDR (Address sent) is cleared by software sequence: a read operation to 
