 990:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  * @param   I2Cx - where x can be (1~4) to select the I2C peripheral.
 991:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *          I2C_IT - specifies the interrupt pending bit to clear.
 992:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_SMBALERT - SMBus Alert interrupt.
 993:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_TIMEOUT - Timeout or Tlow error interrupt.
 994:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_PECERR - PEC error in reception  interrupt.
 995:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_OVR - Overrun/Underrun interrupt (Slave mode).
 996:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_AF - Acknowledge failure interrupt.
 997:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_ARLO - Arbitration lost interrupt (Master mode).
 998:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *            I2C_IT_BERR - Bus error interrupt.
