1000:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *           - STOPF (STOP detection) is cleared by software sequence: a read operation 
1001:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             to I2C_STAR1 register (I2C_GetITStatus()) followed by a write operation to 
1002:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             I2C_CTLR1 register (I2C_Cmd() to re-enable the I2C peripheral).
1003:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *           - ADD10 (10-bit header sent) is cleared by software sequence: a read 
1004:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             operation to I2C_STAR1 (I2C_GetITStatus()) followed by writing the second 
1005:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             byte of the address in I2C_DATAR register.
1006:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *           - BTF (Byte Transfer Finished) is cleared by software sequence: a read 
1007:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             operation to I2C_STAR1 register (I2C_GetITStatus()) followed by a 
1008:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             read/write to I2C_DATAR register (I2C_SendData()).
1009:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *           - ADDR (Address sent) is cleared by software sequence: a read operation to 
1010:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             I2C_STAR1 register (I2C_GetITStatus()) followed by a read operation to 
1011:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             I2C_STAR2 register ((void)(I2Cx->SR2)).
1012:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *           - SB (Start Bit) is cleared by software sequence: a read operation to 
1013:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             I2C_STAR1 register (I2C_GetITStatus()) followed by a write operation to 
1014:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *             I2C_DATAR register (I2C_SendData()).
1015:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  *
1016:c:/Users/User/Documents/GitHub/ch32h417/EVT/EXAM/SRC/Peripheral/src\ch32h417_i2c.c ****  * @return  none
